{"id":"yami_vs_licht","lines":[{"t":0.0,"end":5.767,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"Okay, this is gonna be fun. Been a while since I've had a real fight.","de":"Okay, this is gonna be fun. Been a while since I've had a real fight.","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":10.146,"end":10.963,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"*Slight gasp*","de":"*Slight gasp*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":11.096,"end":12.013,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"Hrugh!","de":"Hrugh!","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":13.479,"end":14.512,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Quiet grunt*","de":"*Quiet grunt*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":18.231,"end":21.998,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"Hyah... HYOI!","de":"Hyah... HYOI!","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":24.946,"end":26.146,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Grunt*","de":"*Grunt*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":33.463,"end":34.53,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"Hyah!","de":"Hyah!","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":38.379,"end":39.579,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Grunt*","de":"*Grunt*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":40.496,"end":41.313,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Another grunt*","de":"*Another grunt*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":43.611,"end":44.678,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"*Quiet grunt*","de":"*Quiet grunt*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":46.496,"end":51.046,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Yells as he gets dragged*","de":"*Yells as he gets dragged*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":51.696,"end":53.813,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*More yelling*","de":"*More yelling*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":58.099,"end":63.916,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"Dark magic: Dark-Cloaked Lightless Slash","de":"Dark magic: Dark-Cloaked Lightless Slash","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":64.779,"end":69.046,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"I thought as much, my magic is being drawn in.","de":"I thought as much, my magic is being drawn in.","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":69.829,"end":70.746,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Grunts as he lands*","de":"*Grunts as he lands*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":70.663,"end":72.98,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"Such is the power of dark magic.","de":"Such is the power of dark magic.","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":73.03,"end":79.196,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"No matter. Now that you've revealed what you're capable of, I should be able to evade capture easily enough.","de":"No matter. Now that you've revealed what you're capable of, I should be able to evade capture easily enough.","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":79.113,"end":85.646,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"Mhm, listen, you were tellin' us some weird little fairy tale earlier, but that wasn't the end of it, was it?","de":"Mhm, listen, you were tellin' us some weird little fairy tale earlier, but that wasn't the end of it, was it?","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":86.163,"end":92.446,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"You're carryin' around a grimoire with a clover on it. You must be from around here, why attack your homeland?","de":"You're carryin' around a grimoire with a clover on it. You must be from around here, why attack your homeland?","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":94.291,"end":98.174,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Grunts as he lands again, exhales, and grunts while blocking attacks*","de":"*Grunts as he lands again, exhales, and grunts while blocking attacks*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":99.346,"end":100.329,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Another quiet grunt*","de":"*Another quiet grunt*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":101.013,"end":102.64,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"Hyah! Heh.","de":"Hyah! Heh.","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":102.69,"end":106.11,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"*Very light grunting*","de":"*Very light grunting*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":102.694,"end":106.111,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Grunting*","de":"*Grunting*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":107.779,"end":108.779,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"Agh!","de":"Agh!","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":110.113,"end":111.313,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"*Grunts*","de":"*Grunts*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":111.579,"end":112.779,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"Eugh!","de":"Eugh!","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":113.113,"end":115.38,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"*Laughs* You're wide open.","de":"*Laughs* You're wide open.","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":117.709,"end":121.69,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"Was that his plan? Leaving an opening to make me careless?","de":"Was that his plan? Leaving an opening to make me careless?","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":121.74,"end":126.274,"chars":[1],"who":"Licht","text":"Yami Sukehiro, you are formidable indeed.","de":"Yami Sukehiro, you are formidable indeed.","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":126.363,"end":127.596,"chars":[0],"who":"Yami","text":"*Grunts in exertion*","de":"*Grunts in exertion*","orig":"scenes/yami_vs_licht/lines/31.mp3"}]}